OL,3,AEight men arrested days after early
OL,4,Arelease from jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, the Ministry of justice
OL,7,F(MOJ) said: "We inherited a prison
OL,8,Fsystem on the brink of collapse. If we
OL,9,Fhad failed to act, the police would
OL,10,Fhave been forced to halt arrests."
